38291>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38294>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38294>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38294>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38294>>>        Handle hoDD
38294>>>
38294>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38295>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38296>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38297>>>
38297>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38297>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38298>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38299>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38300>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38301>>>
38301>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38303>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38304>>>        End
38304>>>>
38304>>>        Else Begin
38305>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38306>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38307>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38308>>>        End
38308>>>>
38308>>>    End_Procedure
38309>>>
38309>>>    Procedure OnViewSaved Handle hoServer Boolean bChanged
38312>>>        // Close after save
38312>>>        Send NavigateClose Self
38313>>>    End_Procedure
38314>>>
